escape_class: scanner_finding
gate_evidence:
  disposition: gate_strengthened
  gate_id: security-scanner-finding
  owner: pm-vitest4112
  negative_control: "The same real public-handler probes fail against installed4.1.11 and pass against4.1.12: synthetic URL injection changes a child-only sentinel; backslash redirect escapes are registered before the patch. Unusual export names and asynchronous rebinding plus allowed redirect are legitimate controls. The captured original hosted OSV receipt independently reports both affected-version advisories. The existing Windows partition workflow contract also fails before adding the advisory suite to the native cohort and passes after that selection is added; native execution remains enforced by the required Windows aggregate."
